<div class=3D"text_cell_render border-box-sizing rendered_html">
<p>Let's start by creating a basic map using cartopy. To do this, we first =
need to define an <code>axes</code> and a <code>projection</code>. Once the=
 projection is defined, we can add coastlines to the map, specifying the li=
newidth and color. We'll delve deeper into <code>projections</code> later o=
n.</p>

</div>
