<h4 id=3D"Add-Features-to-the-Map">Add Features to the Map<a class=3D"ancho=
r-link" href=3D"https://htmtopdf.herokuapp.com/ipynbviewer/temp/a808bfc938d=
dd75b0b9fd3b8dd017db2/3_plot.html?t=3D1690596677326#Add-Features-to-the-Map=
">=C2=B6</a></h4><p>We add features by calling the <code>add_feature()</cod=
e> method on-axis object and passing a feature object available from the <c=
ode>cartopy.feature</code> module.</p>
<p>We can add the following features (part of <code>cartopy.feature</code>)=
 to our map:</p>
<ul>
<li><code>COASTLINE</code>: Adds coastline around all continents.</li>
<li><code>LAND</code>: Adds land on top of world map.</li>
<li><code>LAKES</code>: Adds big lakes of the world.</li>
<li><code>BORDERS</code>: Adds country borders for the whole world.</li>
<li><code>OCEAN</code>: Adds ocean with a color.</li>
<li><code>RIVERS</code>: Adds big rivers of the world.</li>
</ul>

</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"cell border-box-sizing code_cell rendered">
<div class=3D"input">
<div class=3D"prompt input_prompt">In&nbsp;[&nbsp;]:</div>
<div class=3D"inner_cell">
    <div class=3D"input_area">
<div class=3D" highlight hl-python"><pre><span></span><span class=3D"c1"># =
Adding more features and add stock images</span>
<span class=3D"n">plt</span><span class=3D"o">.</span><span class=3D"n">fig=
ure</span><span class=3D"p">(</span><span class=3D"n">figsize</span><span c=
lass=3D"o">=3D</span><span class=3D"p">(</span><span class=3D"mi">12</span>=
<span class=3D"p">,</span><span class=3D"mi">12</span><span class=3D"p">))<=
/span>
<span class=3D"n">map4</span> <span class=3D"o">=3D</span> <span class=3D"n=
">plt</span><span class=3D"o">.</span><span class=3D"n">axes</span><span cl=
ass=3D"p">(</span><span class=3D"n">projection</span><span class=3D"o">=3D<=
/span><span class=3D"n">ccrs</span><span class=3D"o">.</span><span class=3D=
"n">PlateCarree</span><span class=3D"p">())</span>

<span class=3D"n">map4</span><span class=3D"o">.</span><span class=3D"n">ad=
d_feature</span><span class=3D"p">(</span><span class=3D"n">cf</span><span =
class=3D"o">.</span><span class=3D"n">LAND</span><span class=3D"p">)</span>
<span class=3D"n">map4</span><span class=3D"o">.</span><span class=3D"n">ad=
d_feature</span><span class=3D"p">(</span><span class=3D"n">cf</span><span =
class=3D"o">.</span><span class=3D"n">OCEAN</span><span class=3D"p">)</span=
>
<span class=3D"n">map4</span><span class=3D"o">.</span><span class=3D"n">ad=
d_feature</span><span class=3D"p">(</span><span class=3D"n">cf</span><span =
class=3D"o">.</span><span class=3D"n">COASTLINE</span><span class=3D"p">)</=
span>
<span class=3D"n">map4</span><span class=3D"o">.</span><span class=3D"n">ad=
