<div class=3D"text_cell_render border-box-sizing rendered_html">
<h2 id=3D"Download-and-load-data">Download and load data<a class=3D"anchor-=
link" href=3D"https://htmtopdf.herokuapp.com/ipynbviewer/temp/a808bfc938ddd=
75b0b9fd3b8dd017db2/3_plot.html?t=3D1690596677326#Download-and-load-data">=
=C2=B6</a></h2>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"cell border-box-sizing text_cell rendered"><div class=3D"prom=
pt input_prompt">
</div><div class=3D"inner_cell">
<div class=3D"text_cell_render border-box-sizing rendered_html">
<p>We specify the URL in the <strong>file_url</strong> variable.</p>
<p>Next, we make a request to the URL using <strong>requests.get()</strong>=
. The response object contains the content of the file.</p>
<p>We then open a file in binary write mode <strong>("wb")</strong> at the =
desired location <strong>("/content/data.nc")</strong> and write the conten=
t of the response into it.</p>
<p>Finally, we use <strong>xr.open_dataset()</strong> from xarray to open t=
